@page "/terms"
@using Shoppet_VetClinic.Components.Layout
@layout LandingLayout

<PageTitle>Terms & Conditions | ShoppetCare</PageTitle>

<div class="legal-page">
    <main class="legal-shell">
        <span class="legal-kicker">SHOPPETCARE LEGAL</span>
        <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
        <p class="legal-lead">
            These terms describe the rules for using the ShoppetCare student e-commerce pilot platform.
            They are written for the current web and mobile project scope.
        </p>

        <section>
            <h2>1. Platform purpose</h2>
            <p>
                ShoppetCare provides pet-care information management, Digital Pet ID features,
                community posting, a pre-loved pet-item marketplace, and lifetime Premium features.
                ShoppetCare is a student project and is not a veterinary hospital, emergency service, bank, payment
                processor, courier, or insurance provider.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>2. Accounts and responsibilities</h2>
            <p>
                Users are responsible for providing accurate account and pet information, keeping account credentials
                private, and using the platform lawfully. Pet owners buying and selling must submit truthful
                information. ShoppetCare may suspend or remove content that is misleading, unsafe, abusive, or outside
                the intended project scope.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>3. Mock payment environment</h2>
            <p>
                The current checkout is a simulation for academic demonstration. GCash, Maya, and Card options imitate
                a real checkout flow, but no real funds are transferred and no bank, e-wallet, or card network is
                contacted. Do not enter real card credentials. Demo payment references are stored as project transaction
                records for testing and presentation.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>4. Lifetime Premium</h2><p>Premium costs ₱49 once for lifetime access, activated through a successful simulated payment. Free accounts allow one pet and five health records per pet. Every pet owner can buy and sell without a seller subscription.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>5. Marketplace</h2>
            <p>
                Marketplace listings are posted by users. ShoppetCare does not process the physical-item sale, shipping,
                delivery, refund, or buyer-seller settlement. Buyers and sellers arrange the transaction directly.
                Users should avoid unsafe, prohibited, misleading, or inappropriate listings.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>6. Pet-care information</h2>
            <p>
                Pet profiles, vaccination records, health records, food tracking, and related information are owner-
                supplied records. They are not a substitute for veterinary diagnosis, treatment, or emergency care.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>7. Public Digital Pet ID</h2>
            <p>
                Public Pet ID views are intentionally limited. Private owner contact information and private health or
                care information must not be exposed in the public QR view unless the platform explicitly provides a
                separate owner-controlled feature for that purpose.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>8. Community content</h2>
            <p>
                Users retain responsibility for the content they post. ShoppetCare administrators may remove content
                that is abusive, misleading, inappropriate, or violates platform rules.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>9. Pilot limitations</h2>
            <p>
                Because this is an academic pilot, features, sample data, payment simulations, and administrative
                workflows may be reset or revised during development and evaluation.
            </p>
        </section>

        <div class="legal-actions">
            <a href="/privacy">Read Data Privacy Notice</a>
            <a href="/register" class="primary">Create Account</a>
        </div>
    </main>
</div>

<style>
    .legal-page{min-height:100vh;padding:54px 24px;background:#FAF9F6;color:#1E2D27}
    .legal-shell{width:min(920px,100%);margin:auto;padding:44px;border:1px solid #E1E8E5;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(30,45,39,.06)}
    .legal-kicker{color:#2F9098;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em}
    .legal-shell h1{margin:8px 0 10px;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5vw,4rem);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.05em}
    .legal-lead{font-size:1rem;color:#65746E;line-height:1.7}
    .legal-shell section{padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF}
    .legal-shell h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:850}
    .legal-shell p{margin:0;color:#5E6D67;line-height:1.72}
    .legal-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px}
    .legal-actions a{padding:12px 18px;border:1px solid #C9D9D5;border-radius:10px;color:#173D3D;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800}
    .legal-actions .primary{background:#2F9098;border-color:#2F9098;color:#fff}
    @@media(max-width:640px){.legal-shell{padding:26px}}
</style>
